# Prettier's globs walk the filesystem, not the git index, so cdk.out alone put ~1500
# synthesised asset files in front of it — a `--check` over `**/*.ts` reported "1561 files"
# and told you nothing about the 93 files anyone actually edits. Keep this list aligned with
# what git tracks.
node_modules/
cdk.out/
coverage/
*.d.ts

# tsc output (`npm run build` emits here). Gitignored, but prettier globs the filesystem,
# so without this a `--check .` sweeps 58 compiled .js files and reports drift nobody can
# act on — the same trap cdk.out set, missed for dist/ when this file was written.
dist/

# Lambda bundles vendor their own node_modules (image-resize ships sharp), which are
# third-party and must never be reformatted.
lib/lambda/*/node_modules/
